Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 749 "[Lemegeton] At the End of Hell"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900267000
    Collect 1 of 900268000

Requires (player level >= 74 and player is karus and quest 747 is completed) or (player level >= 74 and player is elmorad and quest 748 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Phew, I guess we can breath now.  Let's go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] and start the seal ritual."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Phew, I guess we can breath now.  Let's go to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] and start the seal ritual."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [16Devil] Zepar and [40Devil] Raum."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [16Devil] Zepar and [40Devil] Raum."

On in_progress
    Say "Where did you two sealed?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you.Now sealed with the soul drank in the ring will be locked."

On completed
    Say "We must drive devils into a corner by keeping this mood. We've sealed many numbers of devils already, and I think they're faltering now. By starting with [Devil 28] Berith, who's also called King of Cruelty, you must seal [Devil 52] Alloces and [Devil 68] Belial as well. If you succeed in this mission, they'll shrink back more."
